---
// post@1 — 本篇独立布局组件（T2 落定）：机械移植自旧 posts/crane-lifting-safety-training.html；值 = JSON。
// 守卫纪律（T9）：镜像 approved 投影删未审段——h2/h3 与配对段体同守（j.body?.h_x && j.x，
// 哪个缺都整段不出，防 renderDoc 炸 + 防空标题进 TOC）；zh 源恒全，守卫对 zh 零影响。
import { renderDoc } from '@src/render/render.mjs'
import InquiryForm from '@src/components/shared/InquiryForm.astro'
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs'
import { join } from 'node:path'

const { j } = Astro.props
const repoFrag = name => readFileSync(join(process.cwd(), `src/chrome/${name}.html`), 'utf8')
const WALK = { headingOffset: 1 }
---
<!-- ============ 蓝底标题横幅：面包屑 + 标题 ============ -->
<div class="toptitle">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="title">
			<div class="breadcrumb"><span class="unique_one" data-repeat="breadcrumb-trail" data-repeat-key="breadcrumb-trail" data-array="breadcrumb.trail" data-required>{j.breadcrumb.trail.map(t => <Fragment><span class="crumb" data-item-id={t.id}><a data-field="crumb.url" data-item-field="url" href={t.url}><span data-field="crumb.label" data-item-field="label">{t.label}</span></a><span class="symbol">&gt;</span></span>{' '}</Fragment>)}</span>{' '}<span class="current" data-field="breadcrumb.current" data-required>{j.breadcrumb.current}</span></div><!-- .breadcrumbs -->
			<h1 data-field="title" data-required>{j.title}</h1>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<!-- ============ 文章正文：左 TOC + 右正文（float 两栏） ============ -->
<div id="Topics">
	<div class="TopicsInfo wrap">
		<div class="craneinfo">

			<div id="rank-math-toc" class="wp-block-rank-math-toc-block">
				<p>目录</p>
				<nav><ul></ul></nav>
			</div>

			<!-- 导言 -->
			{j.lead && (
			<div data-field="lead.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.lead.body, WALK)} />
			)}

			<!-- H2 事故警示与风险剖析 -->
			{j.body?.h_accident && (
			<h2 id="accident-warnings" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_accident" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_accident}</h2>
			)}

			{j.body?.h_case && j.accident_cases && (
			<h3 id="typical-accident-cases" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_case" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_case}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_case && j.accident_cases && (
			<div data-field="accident_cases.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.accident_cases.body, WALK)} />
			)}
			{j.body?.img_accident && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.img_accident" data-edit="image" src={j.body.img_accident} alt="起重事故案例警示" width="880" height="731" /></figure>)}

			{j.body?.h_hazard && j.hazards && (
			<h3 id="main-hazards" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_hazard" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_hazard}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_hazard && j.hazards && (
			<div data-field="hazards.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.hazards.body, WALK)} />
			)}
			{j.body?.img_hazard && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.img_hazard" data-edit="image" src={j.body.img_hazard} alt="起重机械伤害发生率统计" width="880" height="729" /></figure>)}

			<!-- H2 核心吊具安全使用与报废标准 -->
			{j.body?.h_gear && (
			<h2 id="lifting-gear-standards" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_gear" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_gear}</h2>
			)}

			{j.body?.h_hook && j.hook && (
			<h3 id="hook-requirements" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_hook" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_hook}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_hook && j.hook && (
			<div data-field="hook.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.hook.body, WALK)} />
			)}

			{j.body?.h_wirerope && j.wirerope && (
			<h3 id="wire-rope-requirements" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_wirerope" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_wirerope}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_wirerope && j.wirerope && (
			<div data-field="wirerope.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.wirerope.body, WALK)} />
			)}
			{j.body?.img_wirerope && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.img_wirerope" data-edit="image" src={j.body.img_wirerope} alt="钢丝绳畸形报废状态示意" width="880" height="577" /></figure>)}

			<!-- H2 操作员标准化安全操作规程 -->
			{j.body?.h_operator && (
			<h2 id="operator-safety-procedures" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_operator" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_operator}</h2>
			)}

			{j.body?.h_basic && j.operator_basic && (
			<h3 id="operator-basic-requirements" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_basic" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_basic}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_basic && j.operator_basic && (
			<div data-field="operator_basic.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.operator_basic.body, WALK)} />
			)}

			{j.body?.h_principles && j.operator_principles && (
			<h3 id="operational-principles" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_principles" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_principles}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_principles && j.operator_principles && (
			<div data-field="operator_principles.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.operator_principles.body, WALK)} />
			)}

			{j.body?.h_emergency && j.emergency && (
			<h3 id="emergency-measures" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_emergency" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_emergency}</h3>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_emergency && j.emergency && (
			<div data-field="emergency.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.emergency.body, WALK)} />
			)}

			<!-- H2 十不吊 -->
			{j.body?.h_nolift && j.nolift && (
			<h2 id="ten-no-lift-rules" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_nolift" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_nolift}</h2>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_nolift && j.nolift && (
			<div data-field="nolift.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.nolift.body, WALK)} />
			)}
			{j.body?.img_nolift && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.img_nolift" data-edit="image" src={j.body.img_nolift} alt="十不吊安全禁令示意" width="880" height="731" /></figure>)}

			<!-- H2 标准指挥手势 -->
			{j.body?.h_signals && j.signals && (
			<h2 id="standard-hand-signals" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_signals" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_signals}</h2>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_signals && j.signals && (
			<div data-field="signals.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.signals.body, WALK)} />
			)}
			{j.body?.signal1_img && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.signal1_img" data-edit="image" src={j.body.signal1_img} alt="标准指挥手势：预备、要主钩、要副钩、吊钩上升" width="880" height="473" /></figure>)}
			{j.body?.signal2_img && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.signal2_img" data-edit="image" src={j.body.signal2_img} alt="标准指挥手势：吊钩水平移动、吊钩微微上升、吊钩下降" width="880" height="430" /></figure>)}
			{j.body?.signal3_img && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.signal3_img" data-edit="image" src={j.body.signal3_img} alt="标准指挥手势：吊钩微微下落、微动范围、吊钩水平微微移动" width="880" height="448" /></figure>)}
			{j.body?.signal4_img && (<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-field="body.signal4_img" data-edit="image" src={j.body.signal4_img} alt="标准指挥手势：指示降落方位、停止、紧急停止、工作结束" width="880" height="426" /></figure>)}

			<!-- H2 结语 -->
			{j.body?.h_conclusion && j.conclusion && (
			<h2 id="conclusion" class="wp-block-heading" data-field="body.h_conclusion" data-edit="text">{j.body.h_conclusion}</h2>
			)}
			{j.body?.h_conclusion && j.conclusion && (
			<div data-field="conclusion.body" data-edit="rich" set:html={renderDoc(j.conclusion.body, WALK)} />
			)}

		</div><!-- /.craneinfo -->
	</div><!-- /.TopicsInfo -->
</div><!-- /#Topics -->

<!-- ============ 询盘表单（共享组件） ============ -->
{j.inquiry_form && <InquiryForm title={j.inquiry_form.title} class="post-inquiry wrap" />}

<!-- ============ photoswipe 灯箱（chrome，逐字复用） ============ -->
<Fragment set:html={repoFrag('photoswipe')} />
